WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
Find Trade, the first place in the rail. This tour hovers the destinations without navigating away.

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.600
Find Markets, the second rail destination and the page shown behind this tour.

3
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.400
Find Portfolio for your balance, positions and record.

4
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.250
Find Games, the fourth destination in the rail.

5
00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:09.150
Find Automate, the fifth rail destination.

6
00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:11.200
Find Leaderboard, the sixth main rail destination.

7
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.850
Open More to see the grouped directory of product pages.

8
00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:21.500
Close More with Escape, then use Command K to open page search.

9
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:25.500
Type proof into page search. The matching list includes Print proof. This tour does not open a search result.

10
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Close search with Escape and use the sun or moon control to switch to dark mode.

11
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Read the pink DevNet environment chip and the test-funds label. Light and dark change the theme within the same environment.

12
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.047
Switch back to light mode. The DevNet seat and its test-funds environment stay the same.
